{"id":"4be51d83c3dcf87f","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-effective-snull.md","title":"有效 s 零类","display":"df-effective-snull — 有效 s 零类","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-effective-snull","aliases":["43-df-effective-snull"],"display":"df-effective-snull — 有效 s 零类","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"§17.1–17.3, printed pp.512–517 / PDF pp.532–537","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-effective-snull"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-effective-snull</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-snull — 有效 s 零类"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§17.1–17.3, printed pp.512–517 / PDF pp.532–537"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(E\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\in\\mathcal P(2^{&lt;\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(V\\in\\mathcal P(2^{&lt;\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OpenHull}\">\\(\\operatorname{OpenHull}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>，统一 c.e. 编码见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EffectiveSNull}(E,s)\\iff\\exists V\\in\\mathcal P(2^{&lt;\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\\;[\\mathrm{CE}(\\{(k,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbb N\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\sigma\\in V_k\\})\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(E\\subseteq\\operatorname{OpenHull}(V_k)\\land\\sum_{\\sigma\\in V_k}2^{-s|\\sigma|}\\le2^{-k})].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EffectiveSNull}(E,s)\\iff\\exists V\\in\\mathcal P(2^{&lt;\\omega})^{\\mathbb N}\\;[\\mathrm{CE}(\\{(k,\\sigma)\\in\\mathbb N\\times2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\sigma\\in V_k\\})\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(E\\subseteq\\operatorname{OpenHull}(V_k)\\land\\sum_{\\sigma\\in V_k}2^{-s|\\sigma|}\\le2^{-k})].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此处保留指数 s 的精确零类，不把在临界指数上的不同随机性概念误认为同一概念。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"